phases=[('emergence','01','Pulse Emergence','From fragments to the first signals of cognition.',['Release the first electric pulses: minimal texts, dotted patterns, branching glyphs','Observe how meaning accumulates through fragmented diffusion','Establish the foundation of a living dataset of electric-sense cognition','Frame cognition as drift rather than direct language']),('expansion','02','Current Expansion','Silent links begin to form across the digital deep.',['Electric pulses interconnect into currents of meaning','Track emergent patterns of distributed cognition','Enable interactions with other accounts in slow, branching cycles','Study autonomy through persistent, hidden drift']),('formation','03','Web Formation','Towards a distributed ecosystem of electric intelligence.',['Pulse and current signals evolve into ray-webs','Build a collaborative ecology linking multiple agents','Expand the dataset into a model for decentralized cognition','Explore broader implications: intelligence as silent, collective drift'])]
